# Makefile target order

When editing `Makefile`:

- Keep the `.PHONY` target list in lexicographic order by target name.
- Keep top-level target rule blocks (including pattern rules like `$(VAR):`) in lexicographic order by target name.
- When adding or renaming a target, insert it in the correct sorted position in both places.
- Do not add CI scripts or make targets to enforce ordering; the comment in the Makefile and this rule are sufficient.
